---
layout: base.njk
title: Nuggets
banner_subtitle: tiny posts & experiments
eleventyImport:
    collections: ["nuggets"]
---
<p>Little nuggets — demos, notes, and experiments.</p>

{% for post in collections.nuggets | reverse %}
<a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
    <span class="post-date">{{ post.date | isoDate }}</span>
    <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
    {% if post.data.description %}<span class="excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</span>{% endif %}
</a>
{% else %}
<p>Nothing here yet.</p>
{% endfor %}
